# This repo has NO root .env — configuration lives per package.
#
#   backend/.env  ← copy from backend/.env.example  (DATABASE_URL, OLLAMA_*, ...)
#   mobile/.env   ← copy from mobile/.env.example   (EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL)
#
# See README.md "環境変数" and docs/setup.md for the full explanation
# (local vs Docker Compose hosts, LAN IP for a physical device, etc.).
#
# Docker Compose passes backend env vars via compose.yaml, so backend/.env
# is mainly for local `npm run dev`.
